    "title": "Minneapolis Homeowners Face Higher Taxes After Commercial Decline - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jordan De La Cruz ,\n1 days ago Minneapolis' commercial property values are slipping again, and homeowners are the ones picking up the slack. As another round of assessments knocks billions off downtown office towers, a larger share of the city's property-tax burden is quietly shifting onto people who own houses and condos, right as city leaders finalize next year's levy. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
